## 2. Derived Data Artifacts and Documentation (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

All data derivatives in this repository—including cross-validation fold assignments (`outputs/stage_a_data/fold_manifest.csv`), label-free out-of-fold predicted probabilities (`outputs/stage_b_training/primary_oof_predictions.csv`, `outputs/stage_c_evaluation/patient_mean_predictions.csv`, `outputs/stage_ac_revision_checks/oof_predictions.csv`), aggregate result tables, and documentation—are derived from the ISLES 2024 public dataset (Zenodo DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.17652035) and are distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) in accordance with its ShareAlike terms.

To view a copy of this license, visit:
